{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347340/extras/4ce1119db9a892d1cbcb96bd0b79186a.avif?t=1759345557\" width=612 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own team and turn it into a true football powerhouse! Use smart tactics, management strategies, and all your ambition to dominate the matches. <strong>Develop your players</strong>, <strong>trade with other clubs</strong>, and shape your squad to match your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this football simulator, you lead your team through challenging, <strong>realistic competitions</strong> and <strong>real-time multiplayer matches</strong> against players from around the world. Prove your skills as a manager and take your club to glory in <strong>UltFoot</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347340/extras/a4c29a6a84df252deb1d57523383542f.avif?t=1759345557\" width=600 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Watch real-time plays, offensive pressure, and player ratings as matches unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Sign, train, and trade players with teams managed by real users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Customize your club with dozens of badges and kits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Challenge friends and strangers in real-time PvP matches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347340/extras/93283e6fba6661f273035a596ad2e568.poster.avif?t=1759345557\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347340/extras/93283e6fba6661f273035a596ad2e568.webm?t=